This distribution contains project-specific modifications to data loading,
evaluation, model components, and experiment configurations. The public release
also reorganizes selected configurations, replaces private machine paths with
local configuration inputs, adds a training entry point, and updates release
documentation. It is not an unmodified upstream MMDetection3D distribution.

Datasets, annotations, sensor calibration, weights, checkpoints, experiment
artifacts, and paper files are not included in this source distribution.
